"semdrift_drift_001555","scikit-learn","master_head","scikit-learn/sklearn/discriminant_analysis.py","fit","def fit(self, X, y):
        """"""Fit the Linear Discriminant Analysis model.

        .. versionchanged:: 0.19
            `store_covariance` and `tol` has been moved to main constructor.

        Parameters
        ----------
        X : array-like of shape (n_samples, n_features)
            Training data.

        y : array-like of shape (n_samples,)
            Target values.

        Returns
        -------
