"semdrift_exp_drift_001898","scipy","e6fa3531f47123a5008fe0909d00256c161b66e9","scipy/special/_basic.py","y1_zeros","def y1_zeros(nt, complex=False):
    """"""Compute nt zeros of Bessel function Y1(z), and derivative at each zero.

    The derivatives are given by Y1'(z1) = Y0(z1) at each zero z1.

    Parameters
    ----------
