>>> t = G(i0)*G(-i0)
>>> kahane_simplify(t)
Matrix([
[4, 0, 0, 0],
[0, 4, 0, 0],
[0, 0, 4, 0],
[0, 0, 0, 4]])

If there are no contractions, the same expression is returned

>>> tc = G(i0)*G(i1)
>>> kahane_simplify(tc)
GammaMatrix(i0)*GammaMatrix(i1)

