        str (bool):
            Create a ``__str__`` method that is identical to ``__repr__``. This
            is usually not necessary except for `Exception`\\ s.

        eq (bool | None):
            If True or None (default), add ``__eq__`` and ``__ne__`` methods
            that check two instances for equality.

            .. seealso::
