[[1, 4], [2], [3], [5, 6, 7, 8]]

References
----------
.. [1] https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bridge_%28graph_theory%29
.. [2] Wang, Tianhao, et al. (2015) A simple algorithm for finding all
    k_arg-edge-connected components.
