.. [2] `Wikipedia entry on the Least-angle regression
       <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Least-angle_regression>`_

.. [3] `Wikipedia entry on the Lasso
       <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lasso_(statistics)>`_

