"semdrift_drift_000266","scikit-learn","master_head","sklearn/ensemble/_weight_boosting.py","_compute_proba_from_decision","def _compute_proba_from_decision(decision, n_classes):
        """"""Compute probabilities from the decision function.

        This is based eq. (15) of [1] where:
            p(y=c|X) = exp((1 / K-1) f_c(X)) / sum_k(exp((1 / K-1) f_k(X)))
                     = softmax((1 / K-1) * f(X))

        References
        ----------
        .. [1] J. Zhu, H. Zou, S. Rosset, T. Hastie, ""Multi-class AdaBoost"",
               2009.
        """"""
        if n_classes == 2:
            decision = np.vstack([-decision, decision]).T / 2
        else:
            decision /= n_classes - 1
        return softmax(decision, copy=False)","Compute probabilities from the decision function.

This is based eq. (15) of [1] where:
    p(y=c|X) = exp((1 / K-1) f_c(X)) / sum_k(exp((1 / K-1) f_k(X)))
             = softmax((1 / K-1) * f(X))

References
----------
.. [1] J. Zhu, H. Zou, S. Rosset, T. Hastie, ""Multi-class AdaBoost"",
       2009.

