"semdrift_exp_drift_001102","sympy","04a7da3aacdf095556c451cd17f3f33bf241a5f2","sympy/polys/agca/homomorphisms.py","quotient_domain","def quotient_domain(self, sm):
        """"""
        Return ``self`` with domain replaced by ``domain/sm``.

        Here ``sm`` must be a submodule of ``self.kernel()``.

        Examples
