n_features : int
    The number of features.

Return
------
log_wishart_norm : array-like of shape (n_components,)
    The log normalization of the Wishart distribution.","1","parameter_rename","Parameter 'log_det_precisions_chol' in code signature is documented under stale identifier 'log__opt'.","train"
