    """"""
    Use the lookup table, to return a resolvent (as dup) for a given
    polynomial *T*.

    Parameters
    ==========

    T : Poly
        The polynomial whose resolvent is needed

    number : int
        For some degrees, there are multiple resolvents.
        Use this to indicate which one you want.

