  >>> from sklearn.metrics.cluster import pair_confusion_matrix
  >>> pair_confusion_matrix([0, 0, 1, 1], [1, 1, 0, 0])
  array([[8, 0],
         [0, 4]]...

Labelings that assign all classes members to the same clusters
