"semdrift_drift_000098","scikit-learn","master_head","sklearn/decomposition/_dict_learning.py","fit_transform","def fit_transform(self, X, y=None):
        """"""Fit the model from data in X and return the transformed data.

        Parameters
        ----------
        X : array-like of shape (n_samples, n_features)
