  for bicluster acquisition
  <https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/articles/PMC2881408/>`__.

Examples
--------
>>> from sklearn.metrics import consensus_score
>>> a = ([[True, False], [False, True]], [[False, True], [True, False]])
