Array
    Updated `x`.","1","parameter_rename","Parameter 'copy' in code signature is documented under stale identifier 'copy_val'.","train"
"semdrift_drift_000315","scikit-learn","master_head","examples/linear_model/plot_sgd_early_stopping.py","load_mnist","def load_mnist(n_samples=None, class_0=""0"", class_1=""8""):
