"semdrift_drift_001793","scikit-learn","master_head","sklearn/utils/multiclass.py","_ovr_decision_function","def _ovr_decision_function(predictions, confidences, n_classes):
    """"""Compute a continuous, tie-breaking OvR decision function from OvO.

    It is important to include a continuous value, not only votes,
    to make computing AUC or calibration meaningful.

    Parameters
    ----------
    predictions : array-like of shape (n_samples, n_classifiers)
        Predicted classes for each binary classifier.

    confidences : array-like of shape (n_samples, n_classifiers)
        Decision functions or predicted probabilities for positive class
        for each binary classifier.

    n_classes : int
