"semdrift_drift_001708","scikit-learn","master_head","sklearn/metrics/pairwise.py","paired_manhattan_distances","def paired_manhattan_distances(X, Y):
    """"""Compute the paired L1 distances between X and Y.

    Distances are calculated between (X[0], Y[0]), (X[1], Y[1]), ...,
    (X[n_samples], Y[n_samples]).

