    If `normalized_stress=True`, returns Stress-1.
    A value of 0 indicates ""perfect"" fit, 0.025 excellent, 0.05 good,
    0.1 fair, and 0.2 poor [1]_.

n_iter : int
    The number of iterations corresponding to the best stress.

References
