.. math::
    \\int_{-1}^{1} \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-x^2}} f(x)\\,dx \\approx
        \\sum_{i=1}^n w_i f(x_i)

The nodes `x_i` of an order `n` quadrature rule are the roots of `T_n`
and the weights `w_i` are given by:

.. math::
    w_i = \\frac{\\pi}{n}

Parameters
==========

n :
