"semdrift_drift_001972","scikit-learn","master_head","examples/model_selection/plot_grid_search_refit_callable.py","best_low_complexity","def best_low_complexity(cv_results):
    """"""
    Balance model complexity with cross-validated score.

    Parameters
    ----------
    cv_results : dict of numpy(masked) ndarrays
        See attribute cv_results_ of `GridSearchCV`.

    Return
    ------
