    column expression, are coerced from Python scalar values if a
    the value is not a :class:`_expression.ColumnElement` subclass.
    For example,
    three fixed values can be compared as in::

        print(between(5, 3, 7))

    Which would produce::

        :param_1 BETWEEN :param_2 AND :param_3

