    labels : array of integers, shape: n_samples
        The cluster labels of vectors.

    References
    ----------
    .. [1] :doi:`Simple, direct, and efficient multi-way spectral clustering, 2019
        Anil Damle, Victor Minden, Lexing Ying
        <10.1093/imaiai/iay008>`

