"semdrift_drift_002266","rich","master_head","rich/rich/_inspect.py","_get_formatted_doc","def _get_formatted_doc(self, object_: Any) -> Optional[str]:
        """"""
        Extract the docstring of an object, process it and returns it.
        The processing consists in cleaning up the docstring's indentation,
