"semdrift_exp_drift_002036","networkx","6da4704cbf32ba6f50f6d9c46cc0a071e3a87985","networkx/generators/small.py","icosahedral_graph","def icosahedral_graph(create_using=None):
    """"""
    Returns the Platonic Icosahedral graph.

    The icosahedral graph has 12 nodes and 30 edges. It is a Platonic graph
    whose nodes have the connectivity of the icosahedron. It is undirected,
    regular and Hamiltonian [1]_.

    Parameters
