"semdrift_exp_drift_001361","sympy","04a7da3aacdf095556c451cd17f3f33bf241a5f2","sympy/ntheory/factor_.py","is_carmichael","def is_carmichael(n):
    """""" Returns True if the numbers `n` is Carmichael number, else False.

    Parameters
