so that they can be used as private keys:

    1. p and q must both be prime
    2. p and q must be distinct
    3. p and q must be congruent to 3 mod 4

Parameters
==========

p, q
    The keys to be checked.

Returns
=======

p, q
    Input values.

Raises
======

