"semdrift_drift_000201","scikit-learn","master_head","sklearn/neural_network/_rbm.py","_free_energy","def _free_energy(self, v):
        """"""Computes the free energy F(v) = - log sum_h exp(-E(v,h)).

        Parameters
        ----------
        v : ndarray of shape (n_samples, n_features)
