----------
X : {ndarray, sparse matrix, sparse array} of shape (n_samples, n_features)
    Data.

    Note that large sparse matrices and arrays requiring `int64`
    indices are not accepted.

y : ndarray of shape (n_samples,) or (n_samples, n_targets)
