    When nbunch2=None:

    >>> list(nx.node_boundary(G, (3, 4)))
    [0, 2, 5]

    When nbunch2 is given:

    >>> list(nx.node_boundary(G, (3, 4), (0, 1, 5)))
    [0, 5]

    Notes
    -----
