"semdrift_drift_002251","scikit-learn","master_head","scikit-learn/sklearn/calibration.py","plot","def plot(self, *, ax=None, name=None, ref_line=True, **kwargs):
        """"""Plot visualization.

        Extra keyword arguments will be passed to
