========

>>> from sympy.functions.combinatorial.numbers import divisor_sigma
>>> from sympy.ntheory.factor_ import is_perfect, divisors
>>> is_perfect(20)
False
>>> is_perfect(6)
True
>>> 6 == divisor_sigma(6) - 6 == sum(divisors(6)[:-1])
True

References
==========

