.. [1] Expander graph, https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Expander_graph
.. [2] Alon-Boppana bound, https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Alon%E2%80%93Boppana_bound
.. [3] Ramanujan graphs, https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ramanujan_graph

