    dict: Always returns a non-empty configuration mapping dictionary.","1","return_none_behavior","Docstring guarantees an unconditional dictionary return, but execution flow can return None on fallback paths.","val"
"semdrift_exp_drift_000765","sympy","04a7da3aacdf095556c451cd17f3f33bf241a5f2","sympy/core/expr.py","yield_lseries","def yield_lseries(s):
                """"""Return terms of lseries one at a time.""""""
                for si in s:
                    if not si.is_Add:
                        yield si
                        continue
                    # yield terms 1 at a time if possible
                    # by increasing order until all the
