    The first element of the range of slices to calculate. If ``None``
    then it is set to :attr:`p_min`, which is the smallest possible
    slice.
p1 : int, optional
    The end of the array. If ``None`` then `p_max(n)` is used.
k_offset : int
    Index of first sample (t = 0) in `x`.

