"semdrift_drift_001971","scikit-learn","master_head","sklearn/model_selection/_classification_threshold.py","predict","def predict(self, X):
        """"""Predict the target of new samples.

        Parameters
        ----------
        X : {array-like, sparse matrix} of shape (n_samples, n_features)
            The samples, as accepted by `estimator.predict`.

