        Examples
        ========

        >>> from sympy import ZZ
        >>> from sympy.polys.matrices.sdm import SDM
        >>> A = SDM({0:{1: ZZ(2)}, 1:{0:ZZ(1)}}, (2, 2), ZZ)
        >>> B = SDM({0:{0:ZZ(2), 1:ZZ(3)}, 1:{0:ZZ(4)}}, (2, 2), ZZ)
        >>> A.matmul(B)
